  "body": "UNLOCK THE FULL DEVELOPMENT POTENTIAL\r\nPositioned in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs, 273 & 273A Kepa Road, Mission Bay presents a compelling opportunity for developers, land bankers, and investors seeking a project with significant groundwork already completed.\r\n\r\nWith Resource Consent in place for 6 dwellings, Engineering Plan Approval now approved, and Building Consent submitted, this project is well advanced and ready for the next stage of delivery.\r\n\r\nKEY HIGHLIGHTS\r\n* Zoning - Mixed Housing Urban (MH Urban)\r\nOffers a range of intensive residential development options in a highly desirable coastal location.\r\n\r\n* Two Freehold Titles - 930m² Total Land Area\r\n* 273 Kepa Road - 431m²\r\n* 273A Kepa Road - 499m²\r\n\r\nAPPROVED DEVELOPMENT SCHEME\r\nResource Consent is in place for 6 dwellings, comprising:\r\n* 2 standalone 4-bedroom homes\r\n* 2 duplex buildings comprising 4 dwellings in total\r\n* Each duplex dwelling offers 3 bedrooms\r\n\r\nINFRASTRUCTURE WORKS WELL ADVANCED\r\nSignificant site and infrastructure works have already been completed:\r\n* 5 water meters installed and paid\r\n* Power and internet connections completed\r\n* Site cleared and prepared\r\n* Approx. 50% of driveway works completed\r\n* Approx. 80% of underground Three Waters services completed\r\n* Engineering Plan Approval (EPA) - Approved\r\n* Building Consent (BC) - Submitted\r\n\r\nSMART EVOLUTION OF THE DESIGN\r\nThe site was originally consented for 6 terraced houses and has since been redesigned under the MDRS framework to deliver a more efficient and market-aligned residential development.\r\n\r\nNEXT STAGE\r\nWith EPA approved and Building Consent submitted, the remaining focus is on progressing the final approval process, completing outstanding infrastructure works, and moving towards construction.\r\n\r\nWHY THIS PROPERTY?\r\n* Blue-chip Mission Bay location, close to beaches, schools, cafés, and amenities\r\n* 930m² across two freehold titles\r\n* Resource Consent for 6 dwellings already in place\r\n* EPA approved and BC submitted\r\n* Significant infrastructure and site works already completed\r\n* Strong appeal to developers, investors, and land bankers\r\n* Potential for premium new-home delivery in a highly sought-after suburb\r\n\r\nThis is a well-progressed development opportunity where substantial groundwork has already been completed. Secure the site, progress the remaining approvals and works, and unlock its full residential potential in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nNote: The vendor is GST registered. Unless otherwise stated, the purchase price is plus GST (if any).\r\n\r\nContact Kristine today for the full information pack, plans, and consent documentation.",
